  "summary": "Against 1.e4, Black plays ...d5 and ...Bg4 to develop quickly and win back the pawn on d5 with active pieces.",
  "goal": {
    "title": "Win back the pawn with fast development",
    "text": "After 1.e4 d5 2.exd5 Nf6 3.d4 Bg4 Black has given a pawn to develop pieces quickly. The goal is to recover the pawn on d5, keep the light-squared bishop active and pose problems before White is fully developed. Avoid retreating passively: every move should add a piece to the fight.",
    "plans": [
      "Recover the d5 pawn with ...Nxd5 or ...Qxd5",
      "Keep the bishop active outside the pawn chain (...Bf5 or ...Bg4)",
      "Develop the rest of the pieces quickly: ...e6, ...Nc6, ...Be7",
      "Castle early and avoid wasting time with the queen"
    ]
  },
